# Python Basics Practice - Day 10

This repository contains beginner Python programs focused on variables, loops, type casting, and control flow concepts.

## Topics Covered
- Variables in Python
- While loops
- Type casting
- Switch/match case examples

## Files
- variable_basics.py
- while_loop_examples.py
- type_casting_examples.py
- switch_case_examples.py

## Learning Goal
To improve understanding of Python control flow and fundamental programming concepts.
